RT @swizzlez_: One of our main goals at @getcoursestack is to help empower the amazing creators building with us to reach as many students as possible. 

So we're launching the Student Hub!  🎓  🚀 

Student Hub brings together the amazing courses, labs, workshops, and events put out by our amazing creators in a central portal - helping students explore and find the best content for their individual goals. 

Today, we're launching with content from some amazing academies powered by the platform:

@Tyler_Ramsbey 's Hack Smarter
@JustHackingHQ 
@NullMode_'s  OgSec
@RedSiege  
@TrustedSec 
@DDI_Training 
@PushSecurity 
@limacharlieio 
@Cyb3rMaddy's HiveAcademy

Across these academies, there are some really awesome courses and labs published by some amazing people! 

We're really excited to help drive them some new students, so if you're in the market for hands-on learning across cybersecurity, IT, coding, and AI, check it out!

